go-stock public snapshot

This repository is a public, cleaned-up derivative snapshot based on the openly published project:
https://github.com/ArvinLovegood/go-stock

The current public repository focuses on maintainable source code, release notes, and documentation suitable for collaboration and secondary development.

Personal donation QR codes, sponsor-code entry points, private integration notes, local workspace files, and oversized generated artifacts have been removed from the public snapshot.
